{"sym":"TSM","name":"Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Company Limited","crypto":false,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductors","country":"Taiwan","employees":76907,"website":"https://www.tsmc.com","exchange":"NYSE","summary":"Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Company Limited, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures, packages, tests, and sells integrated circuits and other semiconductor devices in Taiwan, China, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, Japan, the United States, and internationally. It provides various wafer fabrication processes, such as processes to manufacture complementary metal- oxide-semiconductor (CMOS) logic, mixed-signal, radio frequency, embedded memory, bipolar CMOS mixed-signal, and others. The company also involved in providing customer and engineering support services; manufacturing of masks; investment in technology start-up companies; research, designing, developing, manufacturing, packaging, testing, and sale of color filters; and investment activities. Its products are used in high performance computing, smartphones, Internet of things, automotive, and digital consumer electronics. Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Company Limited was incorporated in 1987 and is headquartered in Hsinchu City, Taiwan.","ko":{"overview":"TSMC는 세계 최대의 반도체 위탁생산(파운드리) 기업입니다. 애플, 엔비디아, AMD 등 주요 칩 설계 회사의 첨단 공정 칩을 생산하며, 첨단 패키징 서비스도 제공합니다.","segments":["웨이퍼 제조 (첨단 공정 로직, 혼성 신호, RF 등)","첨단 패키징 및 테스트","마스크 제작 및 고객 엔지니어링 지원"]},"price":418.51,"prev":412.35,"mc":2170591248384,"next":{"date":"2027-01-14","timing":"bmo","ts":"2027-01-14T12:30Z","estimated":true,"eps_avg":5.1641,"eps_lo":5.102,"eps_hi":5.28,"rev_avg":1705011253270,"rev_lo":1625949000000,"rev_hi":1753006000000},"fin":{"rev":4944817029120,"rev_g":0.509,"eps_g":0.687,"gm":0.6585,"om":0.5866,"pm":0.5112,"roe":0.4185,"fcf":1203071877120},"val":{"pe":27.12,"fpe":17.9,"peg":0.86,"ps":0.44,"pb":79.87,"ev_ebitda":3.92,"eps":15.43,"div":0.9},"health":{"cash":4016980099072,"debt":818380013568,"de":11.